      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "text": "Pricing redesign: ticket dependencies\n\n- An arrow from A to B: A blocks B.\n- Links that other links imply are not drawn.\n- Blue: backend.\n- Green: frontend.\n- Pink: design.\n- Yellow: operations.\n- Two labels: the color of the first label.\n- Click a box to open the ticket in Jira.\n\n88 links in Jira, 67 drawn.",
      "originalText": "Pricing redesign: ticket dependencies\n\n- An arrow from A to B: A blocks B.\n- Links that other links imply are not drawn.\n- Blue: backend.\n- Green: frontend.\n- Pink: design.\n- Yellow: operations.\n- Two labels: the color of the first label.\n- Click a box to open the ticket in Jira.\n\n88 links in Jira, 67 drawn.",
